  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of a national data collection system in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations Office on Drugs and Crime (UNODC) seeks to enhance collaborative methods and improve capacity to combat human trafficking in Southern Africa by establishing a harmonized TIP data collection and reporting system. UNODC will roll out a data collection and reporting system in Tanzania. This will include setting up a national data hub, linked to the UNODC-SADC regional data hub, as well as conducting trainings for users of the system.</narrative>
  </description>
